-- MAHLORT/Uniq.agda   (generated by scratchpad/gen_uniq.py)
--
-- Uniqueness for the Tarski Mahlo universe, relative to TInj
-- (ERT Lemma 4.10 merged with 4.18):
--   type-uniq : G |- A0, G |- A1, |A0| = |A1|            ==>  A0 = A1
--   term-uniq : G |- t0 : A0, G |- t1 : A1, |t0| = |t1|  ==>  Coh G t0 A0 t1 A1
-- by structural recursion on the two derivations (ty-conv and T^ are
-- peeled on either side; erasure determines the matching rule, up to the
-- V/U variants of the codes).  elIm-uniq decodes a code of kind k
-- against a type:  |a| = |A1|  ==>  T_V(KIm k a) = A1.
------------------------------------------------------------------------

